Text recognition for Folio: putting it in
=========================================

Drag the !Folio in this archive over your own !Folio (onto the directory
that holds it): the Filer adds Plugins.OCR to it and leaves the rest of
your !Folio as it is. Then quit Folio and run it again. A Text recognition
entry appears on the document's menu.

To take it out again, delete !Folio.Plugins.OCR (Shift-double-click !Folio
to open it).

!Folio.Plugins.OCR.ReadMe says how to use it.
